# Apex lanes
- UI Survey: menus/HUD chrome/garage sheets — not meshes or GarageDefaults
- Cars: meshes/liveries/presentation — not UI chrome
- Tracks: scenery/audits — one open PR per circuit
- Perf: boot/particles/probes — not weather design
- CI Watch: CI/Pages watcher; specialty bots never arm auto-merge; Merge Desk owns merge-when-green (MERGE commit only)
- Audio / Net / Docs / Insights: stay in named lanes
Prefer Auto/`default` only (no alternate-model fallback); draft PRs on `cursor/<topic>-<hash>` → ship; attach evidence.
Handoff is incomplete without paths, PR/bc, OWNED globs, ranked next ≤3, blockers (or `idle / no PR`).
